      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Analysis of efficiency of respiratory relaxational training and of the visualization method was performed for 90 women with chronic salpingoophoritis and the syndrome of chronic pelvic pain. Use of psychocorrection made possible to improve efficiency of the treatment significantly decreasing intensity of the pain and improving psychological status of the patients. Predictors of efficiency and indications for differentiated use of these methods for the medical rehabilitation of patients were worked out."},
